    <item>
      <title>色彩即结构：先把颜色排进网格，再写字</title>
      <link>https://wunai-xc.github.io/Aesthetics--blog/#/post/color-as-structure</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://wunai-xc.github.io/Aesthetics--blog/#/post/color-as-structure</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 11 Feb 2026 09:00:00 +0800</pubDate>
      <category>色彩</category>
      <category>排版</category>
      <description>大多数人先画版式再上色，结果颜色变成装饰。反过来做——先用三个色相把页面切成区块，字只是落在色块上的附属物。</description>
