    <item>
      <title>排版三级秤：字阶、行高与留白怎么互相让步</title>
      <link>https://wunai-xc.github.io/Aesthetics--blog/#/post/type-scale-three</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://wunai-xc.github.io/Aesthetics--blog/#/post/type-scale-three</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 19 Jan 2026 09:00:00 +0800</pubDate>
      <category>排版</category>
      <category>方法论</category>
      <description>字阶不是一堆数字，而是一把秤。字越大行高越紧、字越小行高越松，留白则由字阶的倍率反推出来。</description>
    </item>

    <item>
